        "line_start": 8,
        "line_end": 8,
        "exact_text": "In `/app/workspace/src/main/java/clusterdata/query/LongestSessionPerJob.java`, implement a Flink job that will identify job stages based on its task activities, and find the stage with the most number of tasks once the job has finished.\n",
        "source_sha256": "7b48140e4198503de244e782199b16245542deb5602df2197525ea210303b01e",
        "extraction_rule": "actionable_paragraph"
      }
    },
    {
